<div id="2026-11-07-custom-creation-any-description" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-11-07 — Custom Creation is any description, not a collar template</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> The custom-part plan no longer adds an OpenSCAD template per shape. Staff type any description. A one-off solid is rendered by the existing OpenSCAD service, which already accepts scad_source, and staff accept or reject the STL.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> A new program per customer part is not a shop tool. The collar remains one example description, not the product.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Not done.</strong> No generator is built. A photo-to-mesh tool is still not in this shop, so a figurine or a photo-only part will not come back as a reliable STL.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>root/Documentation/CustomCreationPlan.tt</code>. Todos #2681–#2687 reworded. Project #310.</p>
</div>
